== Effects ==
* Adds a chance to fire a black tooth that [[poison]]s enemies.
** Black teeth deal double Isaac's normal [[Damage|tear damage]].
** The chance to shoot teeth depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac1 { 33 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck}  \right \rfloor}</math>
*** At base Luck (0), the chance is ~3%, maxing out at 100% at 32 Luck.

== Interactions ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either doubles the chance to fire a black tooth. Having both triples the chance.

